  m_text: 'This sphere combines 2 components together.


    It uses the force zone
    script to pull a ball into the sphere.


    Once inside the sphere your ball
    will hit a teleporter, wait 3 seconds then shoot it out.



    So you can combine
    several of the components included in OpenPutt to do all sorts of things :)'
