  m_text: If you are setting this up as a standalone course, you will need to at
    least keep the ball spawns assigned and positioned. Here we can re-use the ball
    spawns for the distance driving range as the main requirement is using the "Driving
    Range Target" component below on some kind of collider. You might also want to
    put a rigidbody on it to make sure collisions are caught.
