  m_text: "Three custom shader variants are included, each serving a distinct purpose:\r\n\n>
    Height lines and ground noise\r \n> Height lines and tiling texture\r\n> Height
    lines, tiling texture, and ground noise\r\n\r\nThe height lines make it easier
    to read the course's elevation, helping you line up your shots. The ground noise
    provides visual texture, so you don't have to stare at a flat, monochrome surface.\r\n\r\nThe
    shader used in this demo world is the variant featuring the texture, lines, and
    noise combined. You can try out some of the shader settings below."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
